    "description": "### Impact\r\nOn multisite clusters that share one S3 bucket, an admin of one site can download secure uploads that belong to another site. Single-site installs are not affected.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\nKeep `allow_restore` disabled, and only restore backups from trusted sources.\r\n\r\n\nDiscovered by Anthropic's OSS Scanner, as vulnerability ANT-2026-ULA08OOG.",
